                <pb facs="0592" n="584" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg584"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.822/199: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé at
                        Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Childs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-07-12T19:00:00-04:00">July 12, 1941—7 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>85. Your 238, July 3, noon. Your action approved. A note is being telegraphed to
                    the Embassy at Madrid for presentation to the Spanish Government the text of
                    which the Embassy will repeat to you.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
